# UI, Theme, Navigation

Use centralized `ThemeData` (light/dark/system as the app already does). Prefer Material 3 and existing `ColorScheme` / `ThemeExtension` (`app_theme.dart`, `app_theme_extension.dart`). Use `Theme.of(context)` and design tokens (`AppColors`, `text_styles`, padding/radius helpers). Do not scatter hardcoded colors, styles, or magic sizes.

## Layout and performance

Support varied screen sizes (`LayoutBuilder`, `MediaQuery`, `Expanded`/`Flexible`/`Wrap`). This project uses `flutter_screenutil`; follow nearby usage. Prefer `ListView.builder` / `GridView.builder` / slivers for long lists. `const` constructors. No heavy work in `build()`. Use `compute`/isolates only for real CPU-bound work.

## Images

Declare assets in `pubspec.yaml`. `Image.asset` locally; `AppCachedNetworkImage` / `cached_network_image` for remote. Handle loading and error states.

## Accessibility

Contrast, text scaling, semantics on interactive controls, keyboard/pointer on web/desktop where relevant.

## Navigation

Use **go_router** via `AppRouter` / `AppRoutes`. Guards/redirects for auth. `Navigator` only for dialogs and short-lived flows. No navigation in services.
